Flashback to the Women in Film and Television - Toronto (WIFT-T) film fest reception! A highlight of the #TIFF parties - every year I look forward to great conversations with fabulous women making magic in our ever evolving entertainment industry. Belated thanks to @wift.toronto for the invite and @CBC for hosting in that magnificent atrium on Front Street. 
The two stunning humans with me in this pic are examples of women killing it in film and tv. Nikki Duval is a series regular in the new Crave original show New Eden, which I plan to binge this weekend. Juno Rinaldi wrote, produced and stars in the short film Such a Small Thing which is winning all kinds of awards at film festivals because it is a beautiful and provoking piece of art. As you can see in the picture their company inspires my biggest most toothy smile. 
